msgctxt "108"
msgid ""
"Hey, what do you think you're doing! You think you can just\r\n"
"waltz on outta here with that!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "132"
msgid ""
"I mean, shoplifting? At your age? You should be ashamed of\r\n"
"yourself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid ""
"I think you're making a mistake. I haven't taken anything at\r\n"
"all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"Yeah, that's what they all say! Why don't you just save both\r\n"
"of us the trouble and hand over the goods!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Well? Still think I'm a shoplifter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "No... I don't. Sorry to have put you through all that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"One of the part-timers must have made a mistake. Regardless,\r\n"
"that's no excuse to be embarrassing a valuable customer.\r\n"
"Here, please accept this along with our sincerest apologies."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "You got <Color:8>1,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Don't be so quick to judge next time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"I'll try, sir, but you must understand that shoplifting's\r\n"
"been absolutely out of control lately. Even with our high-\r\n"
"tech security cameras, the thieves are still getting away."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Sometimes it's makeup, other times it's the latest toy or\r\n"
"gadget... They're practically robbing us blind, and I simply\r\n"
"refuse to tolerate it any further."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "Sounds like you've got it pretty rough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"I really hate to ask this, especially after what just\r\n"
"happened, but would you mind catching some of these morons\r\n"
"on our behalf?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Huh? Why would you ask me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"Well, those hooligans are already familiar with my staff and\r\n"
"security. But if a stranger like you were to do a stakeout..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"They'd never suspect a thing! Now please, you've got to help\r\n"
"us somehow! I'd be willing to give you compensation, of\r\n"
"course! You could earn part-time wages just standing around!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "So you want me to do undercover security..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Sorry, but that's none of my business. You should be letting\r\n"
"the cops take care of it instead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"Ah... Well... Yeah, I guess it was a stupid idea. Sorry I\r\n"
"brought it up. Shouldn't bother you any more than I\r\n"
"already have, I suppose..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"...I could do that, as long as it's just staking out the\r\n"
"area. If anything, I'm cut out for this type of job."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"Oh... You're really serious!? Thank you, sir! Thank you so\r\n"
"much! Come on inside and I'll fill you in on the details."
msgstr ""

